%% Swap (req_swap)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Invited : resident invites another resident or answers a board post (FR-REQ-02)
  Invited --> Pending : the other resident agrees (FR-REQ-02)
  Invited --> Declined : the other resident declines (FR-REQ-02)
  Invited --> Expired : no answer before expires_at (job, FR-REQ-02)
  Pending --> ToManager : Staff approves, across Blocks (FR-REQ-02)
  Pending --> SwApproved : Staff approves, same Block (FR-REQ-02)
  ToManager --> SwApproved : Manager approves (FR-REQ-02)
  Pending --> SwRejected : Staff rejects (FR-REQ-02)
  ToManager --> SwRejected : Manager rejects (FR-REQ-02)
  Invited --> SwCancelled : a resident cancels
  Pending --> SwCancelled : a resident cancels
  ToManager : To Manager
  SwApproved : Approved
  SwRejected : Rejected
  SwCancelled : Cancelled
